Table 1
 shows the results of different steps of enzyme purification. A total of 48.6 mg of purified enzyme was collected from 5 L of cultured supernatant. The purification fold and yield were 1.65-fold and 9.4%. Homogeneous PBS depolymerase formed a single band on a 12% SDS-PAGE gel. The molecular mass of the purified enzyme was determined to be approximately 20 kDa by SDS-PAGE (Fig. 7
).
